5. Conditions to retain the scholarship after the first semester
The scholarship will be automatically renewed if the student ensures as the following:



- Not failing any modules in the list of modules of the semester/academic year under
consideration;
- Successfully completing all modules in the list of modules of the semester/academic
year under consideration;
- Achieving a GPA equal to or better than 2.30 (German grading scale) or (7.70
Vietnamese grading scale) in the semester/academic year under consideration;
- Not violating the University’s regulations and policies;
- Not applying for study deferral, or study termination, or program transfer;
- Participation in social contribution activities and/or student club activities is
encouraged.

